..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : CARRIERENTRY.SE
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : dsch
.. Functionality  : Screen enter event for info system carrier entry
..*****************************************************************************
..<META M|='la/CARRIERENTRY'>
.set trans -
..
.formula M|kabm = "4120"
.formula M|kschema = M|kabm^imschema^id
..
.. Set highlighting color
.input "is/ABASFARBEN.DEF"
.formula M|colquantity = U|xabaslightyellow
.formula M|colerror = U|xabaslightred
.formula M|colrequired = U|xabaslightyellow
..
.. Read settings from edi import configuration
.input "dfue/DFUE.IMP.INI"
.assign M|kempverz = T|xempfangsverz
..
.. Read own company information
.formula M|kempfaenger = 'F|sysinfo(10)^sucherw'
.formula M|kempfgln = 'F|sysinfo(10)^gln'
.formula M|kempfustid = 'F|sysinfo(10)^ustid'
..
.. Default settings
.formula M|kdokuart = "(Incoming)"
..
.. Highlight required fields
.. Non-highlighted required fields are kdokuart and kabm, which are set with default values
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' kkreislauf 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' ksender 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' ksendergln 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' ksenderustid 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' kdatumvon 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' kdatumbis 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' kdatumauszug 0
.colour -foreground -1 -1 -1 -background 'M|colrequired' kkoaznr 0
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
